 RADD DX SB; STX PTR,B; SAT STRX;
       RADD DT SB; SAA 30; SAD SHR 20; JPL I (SETUP
       
       JPL I (WHUSR; STA MBUF,B
       LDT I 9CMD; LDX CPTR,B; SAA 1; JPL I 9PCF; JMP SSS
       LDX CPTR,B; JPL I 9GCI; JMP SFF
       SAT ##(; SKP IF DA EQL ST; JMP S5
S2,    LDX CPTR,B; JPL I 9GCI; JMP SFF
       SAT ##); SKP IF DA UEQ ST; JMP S3
       LDX PTR,B; JPL I 9WCI; JMP SFF; JMP S2
S3,    LDX PTR,B; JPL I (LEN; SKP IF DD EQL 0; JMP *+4
       SAA 1; STA MBUF,B; JMP S4
       LDX PTR,B; JPL I (GUNUM; JMP SF4; STA MBUF,B
       LDX PTR,B; JPL I (STRST
S4,    LDX CPTR,B; JPL I 9GCI; JMP S6
