S6,    SAA -1; STA I (ACTLK
       LDA MBUF,B; COPY DD SA; LDX PTR,B; SAA 1
       SAT MBUF; RADD DT SB; JPL I (FILE; JMP SFY
       LDT I 9CMD; SAA 25; JPL I 9PCF; JMP SSS; COPY DT SA
       SAX MBUF; RADD DX SB; SAA 0; JPL I (SFILA; JMP SFX
SSS,   MIN LREG,B
SFF,   STZ I (ACTLK; RET

       RCLR DP AD1
       SF4,   SAA 4; JMP SFX
SFX,   JPL I (ERMSG; JMP SSS
SFY,   AAA 1; JAF *+3; SAA 10; JMP SFX; SAA 37; JMP SFX
9PCF,  PCF
9CMD,  CMDLN
9GCI,  GCI
9WCI,  WCI
       )FILL
