       RCLR DP AD1
       PF1,   LDX (MS1; JPL I (MSG; JMP PFF
PF2,   LDX PTR1,B; JPL I (LEN; COPY DA SD; STA RADX,B
       LDX PTR1,B; RCLR DA; RCLR DD; JPL I (SETR
       LDX PTR1,B; JPL I (LEN; COPY DA SD; SUB RADX,B
       ADD NBLK,B; COPY CM2 DX SA
       SAA ## ; JPL I (TCO; JNC *-2
       LDX (MS2; JPL I (MSG; JMP PFF
P30,   LDT PTR1,B; JPL I (TRIM; SAA 12; STA RADX,B; JMP I (P2Q
       )FILL
       )PCL FPCF



