D1,    ENTER

       STA I *+3; SAA 2; SWAP DP SA; SAVA; ZYX-1
              COPY DB SX; STSET CPTR,CSTR,CSTRX,16
       SAX CSTR; RADD DX SB; STX CPTR,B; SAT CSTRX;
       RADD DT SB; SAA 16; SAD SHR 20; JPL I (SETUP
       
       JPL I (WHUSR; AAA -1; JAF DF46
