       SAA NOFT; SKP IF DT LST SA; JMP SF14; STT OFTN,B
       LDX (OFT; LDA I OFTN,B,X; JAP SF14; BSKP ZRO 160 DA; JMP SF12
       JPL I (OFTX; STA OBJ,B
       ENINT; DSINT; LDA I OBJ,B; JAN *-3
